    "body": "Got it, thank you for the update. I would still love to work on this issue, should this also update the additional destinations such as \"frame\"AND \"iFrame\" since they both return \"frame-src\"? From what I understand, the issue asks to update the list to Content Security Policy Level 3. The ref (https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#effective-directive-for-a-request) shows destinations such as 'script' to return 'script-src-elem' and more from the CSP level 3 list. If there is something I am not understanding, please let me know. Thank you! ",
